{"title":"The Radavist Podcast Ep 10: Tom Ritchey — The Man, the Myth, the Maker Has a New Memoir!","link":"https://theradavist.com/the-radavist-podcast-ep10-tom-ritchey-memoir","date":1795504369000,"content":"<p><em>Got holiday travel ahead? Queue up the latest episode of The Radavist Podcast to hear stories from Tom Ritchey about his early influences and racing days, his soon-to-be-released memoir, and his takes on bike design in part one of this two-part conversation. <span></span></em></p>\n<p>Tom Ritchey needs no introduction here. Ahead of the release of his new memoir <em>One Ride Away From Figuring It Out: Bicycles, Innovation, Life, </em>Tom talks with Hailey about his formative years and designing for off-road riding and what would become the mountain bike, in part one of this two-part episode.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/a220931154b451a7ec9468595c52571dc88d2ff44a2242fc349a78cf492ae50e.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/5c547514d8011bbca4f3c0e2cbfd4d09d8775a4bcddae47f74f60a087a3ee3b4.jpg 800w, /media/35dfd24e082ed5c27c13e6d8f6b0ee3ba8f640ff76d684df91094e489f4ab133.jpg 1600w, /media/a220931154b451a7ec9468595c52571dc88d2ff44a2242fc349a78cf492ae50e.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/4e02549f736e542a27c267284b5bbac021a1667b31796aa4372d75708ade59b8.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/4ec51fa2ace6f6c9068863b4a04992c62bd5c140091eb99104f6ca8457b8b1a2.jpg 800w, /media/cdd9b4d6593dfeda1eba1703621e022d7203fcaa5c6f83429f17c0174eda56f4.jpg 1600w, /media/4e02549f736e542a27c267284b5bbac021a1667b31796aa4372d75708ade59b8.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" /></p>\n<p><em>From this <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/1980-no-serial-ritchey-mtb\" target=\"_blank\">1980 no serial-number mountain bike</a> (left) to the production carbon<a href=\"https://theradavist.com/ritchey-septimer-break-away-review\" target=\"_blank\"> Ritchey Septimer Breakaway</a> (right), Tom’s career has spanned 50 years and many, many bikes.</em></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/ffc7cf6e78d6adf8325dd456a1e76e8c6b387af5533b87e56db72f2ff86d6cf0.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/d255fc0d85a5092cc4f062401f14f8c1a23b2399f0c0e7ffbeb4e9035555d21c.jpg 800w, /media/fee55fc6c14acba5a0662fbbbd932f00cbf8098b35aa388965f9378bf299f26d.jpg 1600w, /media/ffc7cf6e78d6adf8325dd456a1e76e8c6b387af5533b87e56db72f2ff86d6cf0.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"793\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/4edce14f06802ffb47ab49ccd915855b9acc8df3f4f8a63b37a7930e47ef0393.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/ade1acce6d657fc53e5a10534a972df326e494ce7d6d8e708d377fb156be65fe.jpg 800w, /media/3789b0a0898ef65a14f221a51346095940054edd3af174e1627705527dd60096.jpg 1600w, /media/4edce14f06802ffb47ab49ccd915855b9acc8df3f4f8a63b37a7930e47ef0393.jpg\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\" /></p>\n<p>Follow <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/isolapress\" target=\"_blank\">Isola Press</a> for updates on the book release date, or <a href=\"https://www.isolapress.com/shop/tom-ritchey-memoir\" target=\"_blank\">pre-order here</a>!</p>\n<p><span>﻿</span><span>﻿</span></p>\n<p>Listen to The Radavist Podcast on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/6X6Pd3oe4UjnecqCUJRViS?si=16ba7c60c13d407e\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>, <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-radavist-podcast/id1874030722\" target=\"_blank\">Apple Podcasts</a>, or <a href=\"https://music.amazon.com/podcasts/6a905a23-4f9d-4b69-86e5-6452fa217073/the-radavist-podcast\" target=\"_blank\">Amazon Music</a>. You can also use an <a href=\"https://api.riverside.fm/hosting/sKjhmj6O.rss\" target=\"_blank\">RSS feed</a>.</p>\n<p>And please, if you like the content we produce over here, please sign up to support us via <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/membership/join\" target=\"_blank\">The Radavist Membership</a>.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/the-radavist-podcast-ep10-tom-ritchey-memoir\">The Radavist Podcast Ep 10: Tom Ritchey — The Man, the Myth, the Maker Has a New Memoir!</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://cms.theradavist.com/\">The Radavist</a>.</p>","author":"Hailey Moore","comments":"https://theradavist.com/the-radavist-podcast-ep10-tom-ritchey-memoir#comments","siteTitle":"The Radavist","siteHash":"96eb481d8084f04a4602bac57874ba717baf56b758f45547b5caf2312da766ef","entryHash":"01e9449d1117d62e0659aa105188b80945bf9b92eadf78eb3c929de34a574426","category":"Cycling"}